docs {
  Read-only routes of the Angular front (D-088, F18.1): agent telemetry, history, inventory, software, ticket
  summary and log, judge detail, users and the error queue. They only read, so the folder runs any number of
  times; lists that need demo data check `demoMinItems`.
}
